***conformance tests***

# accepts-hyphen-joined-segments
`a`, `add-task`, `add-task-2`, `2`, `a-b-c` and `x1-y2` are each a :SemanticId:.

# rejects-other-shapes
The empty text, `-`, `---`, `-add-task`, `add-task-`, `add--task`, `add_task`, `Add-task`, `add task`, `add.task` and `ädd` are each not a :SemanticId:.

***acceptance tests***
